sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Priya / CMP-011
  participant E as CMP-008 Assurance
  participant F as FIN-001/CAP-001/PRR-001
  participant S as Marcus/Sofia/Liam evidence owners
  participant D as Daniel and Aisha
  participant R as Deployment authority (external, not implemented)

  P->>E: Build DecisionEvidenceIndex (INT-241)
  E->>F: Collect cost, capacity, SLO, DR, readiness evidence
  F-->>E: Proposed/local evidence with authority_effect:none
  E->>S: Resolve evidence ownership and blocker status
  S-->>E: Missing/local/proposed/unapproved/unexercised statuses
  E->>E: Apply conjunctive hard-blocker assessment
  E-->>P: DATA-283 FinalProductionReadinessAssessment = denied
  P->>D: Present evidence, RACI, risks and remediation backlog
  D-->>P: Accept denial and pre-production remediation plan
  P-xR: No route activation request is issued
  Note over P,R: A readiness assessment is evidence, not deployment authority.
